  ✓ Rebuild semantics and independently run all positive proof claims
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, program pinning, and every local K rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  → Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
